{"unit_id":"StarsTom__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"StarsTom/dsh-session-delete","commit":"8e2e8a86190c51697605810b9f29e97eff32bc75","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的会话管理插件：它在会话菜单加入永久删除入口，并通过 loopback RPC 调用服务端删除流程。用户点击后可核对会话名称并勾选确认；活动会话会先停止 agent、等待写入，再清理运行态注册。插件支持活动与未加载会话，但只处理默认 JSONL 后端，并检查删除目录位于持久化根目录内。适合需要从 Web 会话列表移除旧会话的用户；需要 DSH Web、Node.js 20+ 和默认 JSONL 后端。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:128-169","lib/client.js:201-265","lib/index.js:127-146","lib/index.js:170-200","lib/index.js:274-290"]}
{"unit_id":"StarsTom__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"StarsTom/dsh-session-delete","commit":"8e2e8a86190c51697605810b9f29e97eff32bc75","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-delete adds confirmed deletion to the DeepSeek Harness Web session menu. It handles active and unloaded sessions, waits for active writes, then cleans runtime state. It supports the default JSONL backend and checks the target directory is below its root. Requires DSH Web and Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:128-169","lib/client.js:201-265","lib/index.js:127-146","lib/index.js:170-200","lib/index.js:274-290"]}
